  "result": "```json\n{\n    \"smpl.ordering.repositories.CatalogItemsRepository\": {\n        \"summary\": \"Interface for repositories holding catalog item data. It defines the contract for CRUD operations on catalog items. Key methods include: getCatalogItems() - retrieves all catalog items as a list; getCatalogItem(String sku) - retrieves a single catalog item by its SKU identifier; upsertCatalogItem(String sku, CatalogItem catalogItem, String eTag) - inserts or updates a catalog item identified by SKU, using an eTag for optimistic concurrency control, returning a boolean indicating success; removeCatalogItem(String sku, String eTag) - removes a catalog item by SKU with eTag-based concurrency control, returning a boolean indicating success. The @SuppressWarnings annotation suppresses 'SameParameterValue' and 'UnusedParameters' warnings, suggesting it is designed as an abstraction layer where some parameters may appear redundant in certain implementations.\",\n        \"file_path\": \"smpl/ordering/repositories/CatalogItemsRepository.java\"\n    }\n}\n```",
